      "source_provenance": "Paper Table 1 and text; D1 dissociation barrier 10.58 kcal/mol, O removal barrier 6.68 kcal/mol.",
      "generation_method": "Extracted directly from the published manuscript (Table 1 and relevant text).",
      "why_not_fabricated": "Values are the paper's own reported data for the exact quantities being reproduced."
    }
  ],
  "output_contract": {
    "outputs": [
